# Command Bridge: "This land enters tapped. When this land enters, sacrifice it unless you tap an untapped permanent you control.
# {T}: Add one mana of any color." Turn 1 Bot1 plays it with an untapped Mox Ruby and pays by tapping the Mox: the Bridge stays, tapped
# (the Mox, tapped, is not mana in the pool). On turn 3 both untap and the Bridge, tapped for red, alone pays Lightning Bolt (3 to Bot2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Command Bridge
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Command Bridge.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.PayCost
Bot1.Choose(Mox Ruby)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Command Bridge.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Command Bridge.Activate(Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Command Bridge
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Command Bridge.Tapped = true
